invariant: INV-54
file: proof/coverage.py
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: a harness that reaches exactly its floor fails the check. The
  floor is the fewest locations a harness may reach, so the count it
  records must pass. lint-matrix runs main over a stand-in for cbmc that
  reaches 50 locations under a floor of 50 and requires exit 0.

--- old
            if reached < floor:
--- new
            if reached <= floor:
